# The allowlist of the write filter: what a page outside CONFIG and Library/
# may call or reference (docs/security.md, section 6). One entry per line:
# `name`, `name.sub`, `name.*` or `*.method`. Every entry is audited before
# it is added; the never-allowed names cannot be added, the server refuses to
# serve on an entry that covers one. This file is the shipped default, which
# the image carries at /etc/silverbullet-mcp/allowlist.

query
template.each
templates.*
views.*
string.*

# The index functions that read; the ones that write or register are never allowed.
index.aggregates
index.aspiringPages
index.contentPages
index.describeSchema
index.documents
index.extractFrontmatter
index.getObjectByRef
index.headers
index.isAvailable
index.items
index.links
index.metaPages
index.objects
index.pages
index.paragraphs
index.relations
index.resolveAnchor
index.subPages
index.tables
index.tag
index.tagSchema
index.tags
index.tasks
